 "equipment_type": "Sensor (battery monitoring system)",
 "applies_to": "Alber MPM-100 (firmware 1.20+) and BDS series (controller firmware 2.20+) battery monitors with BMDM software 4.10+, per protocol document SL-29417 Rev 7.05.",
 "summary": "The Alber MPM-100 and BDS monitor stationary battery strings: cell voltages, intercell and intertier resistances, string voltage, currents, temperatures and alarms. They speak Modbus ASCII (7 data bits, 2 stop bits, 9600 baud) with functions 03 and 16; values are 16-bit integers with power-of-two scaling. This map covers representative cell voltage and resistance registers, overall voltage, time-to-go, system status, the firmware command register and configuration basics.",
 "transport": [
  "ASCII"
 ],
